        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Rhythm and Riffs is a high-energy fusion of live music and longform improv, where each show features a different musical guest &amp;#8211; that can range from rap, jazz, country, folk, full bands, and beyond &amp;#8211; whose performance inspires a completely improvised comedy set. No two shows are the same. With a cast of seasoned performers and a spotlight on Chicago’s diverse music scene, Rhythm and Riffs feels like a concert, sounds like a mixtape, and plays out like your favorite night out.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
      }
    ],
