    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #191919;&quot;&gt;Find out for yourself why The Second City has been the first name in laughter for over sixty years! From the stages that launched the careers of Tina Fey, Stephen Colbert, Steve Carell and more comes the next generation of comedy superstars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #191919;&quot;&gt;The Best of The Second City features some of the best sketch comedy and songs from our comedy vaults updated for the modern era, as well as some of our newest classics and our trademark improvisation performed by The Second City Touring Company’s best and brightest…and funniest!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Group of 10 or more? We’ll make it easy: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.secondcity.com/group-events&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Contact Us for Group Events&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n"
