      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sleeping Giant is a solo show written and performed by local comedian and tall person, Tom Rhoads.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Audiences across the country have described this show as a delightful journey into the mind of a gentle giant.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
